[list]
[*] Hands add nothing to colony wealth, send no letters and leave no corpses.
[*] The work and rescue psycasts can be cast without drafting.
[*] Hands vanish if their caster is downed, dies or leaves the map.
[*] Requires Biotech: the hands run on the mechanoid work system, with no mechanitor or bandwidth needed.
[*] Find it on VPE's Arcanum tab.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JaimeBarrachina/Arcanum/main/PhantomHand/Art/workshop/banner_requirements.png[/img]

[list]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2009463077]Harmony[/url]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2023507013]Vanilla Expanded Framework[/url]
[*] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2842502659]Vanilla Psycasts Expanded[/url]
[*] Biotech
[/list]

Inspired by the summons of A RimWorld of Magic.

